  "note": "The passage gives the features shared by the permitted insects but no feature unique to the ḥargōl. ‘Cricket’ is a traditional rendering. The Sabaic comparison is tentative because the term denotes a crop scourge and its initial consonant differs. Kogan also tentatively identifies an early form in the Ebla lexical list VE 1095."
